+# CLAUDE.md
+
+This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.
+
+## Project
+
+`shop-api` — a TypeScript API. The repo is at an early stage: currently the only source file is `src/money.ts`. `package.json` declares no dependencies yet, so `tsx`, `vitest` and `eslint` must be added before the scripts below will run.
+
+## Commands
+
+- `npm run dev` — run the server in watch mode (`tsx watch src/index.ts`; `src/index.ts` does not exist yet)
+- `npm test` — run all tests once (`vitest run`)
+- `npx vitest run path/to/file.test.ts` — run a single test file; add `-t "test name"` to filter by test name
+- `npm run lint` — ESLint over the whole repo
+
+Run `npm test` before pushing. CI runs lint as well, so run `npm run lint` too.
+
+## Rules (from CONTRIBUTING.md)
+
+- **Money is always integer cents.** Use the `Cents` type from `src/money.ts` and never use floats for amounts. `Cents` is a plain `number` alias, so the compiler won't catch a float. You have to keep values integral yourself.
+- **Migrations:** never edit a migration that has shipped. Add a new one instead.
+- **`legacy/` is frozen.** Change it only for security fixes. The folder doesn't exist yet; the rule applies once it does.
